{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32547","headline":"姑苏台 · 刘驾","name":"姑苏台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勾践饮胆日，吴酒正满杯。\n笙歌入海云，声自姑苏来。\n西施舞初罢，侍儿整金钗。\n衆女不敢妒，自比泉下泥。\n越鼓声腾腾，吴天隔尘埃。\n难将甬东地，更学会稽栖。\n霸迹一朝尽，草中棠梨开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}